SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal GPS (SSP 100ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 2ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Inertial (SSP 15ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 2ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal SteeringWheelPosition (SSP 20ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 2ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal BrakePedalPosition (SSP 20ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 2ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal AccelerationPedalPosition (SSP 20ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 2ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera1 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera2 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera3 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera4 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera5 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera6 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Camera7 (SSP 33ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal LiDAR (SSP 100ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 10ms+/-5ms)
    Sensor Signal Radar (SSP 100ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Wheel1Speed (SSP 25ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Wheel2Speed (SSP 25ms+/-1ms offset varying, DL 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Wheel3Speed (SSP 25ms+/-1ms  offset varying, DL 5ms+/-1ms)
    Sensor Signal Wheel4Speed (SSP 25ms+/-1ms  offset varying, DL 5ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal Braking (trigger on event, AD 10ms+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal CollisionAlert (trigger on event, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal PassingVehicleIndicator (trigger on event, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal NavigationHint (period 40ms+/-1ms offset varying, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal SpeedingAlert (period 40ms+/-1ms offset varying, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal LaneDepartureAlert (trigger on event, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal AwarenessAlert (period 40ms+/-1ms offset varying, AD 2ms+/-1ms)
App :
    Component Fusion:
        Signal Position
        Signal Speed
        Service Positioning:
            subscribe to VSS signal GPS
            subscribe to VSS signal Inertial
            publish to Position
            trigger on Inertial
            execution 1ms+/-0ms using cpu0
        Service Speed:
            subscribe to VSS signal Wheel1Speed
            subscribe to VSS signal Wheel2Speed
            subscribe to VSS signal Wheel3Speed
            subscribe to VSS signal Wheel4Speed
            publish to Speed
            period 25ms+/-1ms offset varying
            execution 1ms+/-0ms using cpu0

    Component Perception :
        Signal CameraEnvironment
        Signal LiDAREnvironment
        Signal RadarEnvironment
        Signal EnvironmentMap
        Service CameraPerception:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera1
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera2
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera3
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera4
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera5
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera6
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera7
            publish to CameraEnvironment
            period 100ms+/-10ms offset varying
            execution 10ms+/-3ms using gpu0
        Service LiDARPerception:
            subscribe to VSS signal LiDAR
            publish to LiDAREnvironment
            trigger on LiDAR
            execution 30ms+/-10ms using gpu0
        Service RadarPerception:
            subscribe to VSS signal Radar
            publish to RadarEnvironment
            trigger on Radar
            execution 10ms+/-4ms using gpu0
        Service Fusion:
            subscribe to CameraEnvironment
            subscribe to LiDAREnvironment
            subscribe to RadarEnvironment
            publish to EnvironmentMap
            period 100ms+/-5ms offset varying
            execution 25ms+/-5ms using gpu1
    Component SemanticExtraction:
        Signal Lanes
        Signal Signs
        Signal Vehicles
        Signal Pedestrians
        Signal Cyclist
        Signal StaticObjects
        Signal Trajectories
        Signal EgoTrajectory
        Signal SpeedLimitSigns
        Signal DirectionSigns
        Service ObjectDetection:
            subscribe to EnvironmentMap
            publish to Lanes
            publish to Signs
            publish to Vehicles
            publish to Pedestrians
            publish to Cyclist
            publish to StaticObjects
            trigger on EnvironmentMap
            execution 50ms+/-10ms using gpu1
        Service Prediction:
            subscribe to Lanes
            subscribe to Signs
            subscribe to Vehicles
            subscribe to Pedestrians
            subscribe to Cyclist
            subscribe to VSS signal SteeringWheelPosition
            subscribe to VSS signal BrakePedalPosition
            subscribe to VSS signal AccelerationPedalPosition
            subscribe to Speed
            publish to Trajectories
            publish to EgoTrajectory
            trigger on Vehicles
            execution 10ms+/-1ms using cpu1
        Service SignInterpretation:
            subscribe to Signs
            publish to SpeedLimitSigns
            publish to DirectionSigns
            period 200ms+/-20ms offset varying
            execution 10ms+/-5ms using gpu1

    Component CollisionDetection:
        Signal TimeToCollision
        Service TimeToCollision:
            subscribe to Trajectories
            subscribe to Speed
            publish to TimeToCollision
            period 200ms+/-10ms offset varying
            execution 30ms+/-5ms using cpu1
        Service BrakingDecision:
            subscribe to TimeToCollision
            publish to VSS signal Braking
            publish to VSS signal CollisionAlert
            trigger on TimeToCollision
            execution 5ms+/-2ms using cpu1

    Component Assistance:
        Service BlindSpot:
            subscribe to Trajectories
            publish to VSS signal PassingVehicleIndicator
            trigger on Trajectories
            execution 10ms+/-5ms using cpu2
        Service Navigation:
            subscribe to Position
            subscribe to EgoTrajectory
            subscribe to DirectionSigns
            publish to VSS signal NavigationHint
            period 100ms+/-20ms offset varying
            execution 50ms+/-10ms using cpu2
        Service Speeding:
            subscribe to SpeedLimitSigns
            publish to VSS signal SpeedingAlert
            period 500ms+/-100ms offset varying
            execution 2ms+/-0ms using cpu2
        Service LaneMonitoring:
            subscribe to Lanes
            subscribe to EgoTrajectory
            publish to VSS signal LaneDepartureAlert
            trigger on Lanes
            execution 5ms+/-1ms using cpu2
        Service PedestrianNotification:
            subscribe to Pedestrians
            subscribe to Cyclist
            publish to VSS signal AwarenessAlert
            period 1000ms+/-100ms offset varying
            execution 10ms+/-3ms using cpu2

Resource :
    Execution gpu0
    Execution gpu1
    Execution cpu0
    Execution cpu1
    Execution cpu2
    Execution cpu3

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera1 -> CameraPerception -> Fusion -> ObjectDetection -> Prediction -> TimeToCollision -> BrakingDecision -> Braking